{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>שבענו</b> — If <b>שבענו חסדך בבקר</b>, then we shall rejoice all day. And the meaning: if You act with us with kindness in our youth, that You teach us the straight path — then we shall rejoice all our days, even in old age."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 90, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:48.502014120Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}